hadiths[18]{hadithnumber,text}:
"238","Asbagh ne hum se bayan kiya unhon ne kaha mujhe Ibn Wahb ne khabar di unhon ne kaha mujhe Khalid bin Humaid ne khabar di Khalid bin Yazid se Sulaiman bin Rashid se Abdullah bin Rafi se Hazrat Abu Huraira se unhon ne farmaya Momin apne bhai ka aaina hai jab us mein koi aib dekhe to use durust kare."
"239","Ibrahim bin Hamza ne hum se bayan kiya unhon ne kaha hum se Ibn Abi Hazim ne bayan kiya Kaseer bin Zaid se Waleed bin Rabah se Hazrat Abu Huraira se Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se Aap ne farmaya Momin apne bhai ka aaina hai aur momin momin ka bhai hai wo us ke zaya hone ko rokta hai aur us ki peeth peeche us ki hifazat karta hai."
"240","Ahmad bin Asim ne hum se bayan kiya unhon ne kaha mujhe Haiwah ne bayan kiya unhon ne kaha hum se Baqiyyah ne bayan kiya Ibn Thauban se un ke walid se Makhul se Waqqas bin Rabiah se Mustawrid se Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se Aap ne farmaya Jo kisi musalman ke zariye ek luqma khaye to beshak Allah use us jaisa Jahannam se khilayega aur jise kisi musalman shakhs ke zariye kapda pehnaya gaya to beshak Allah azza wa jalla use Jahannam se pehnayega aur jo kisi shakhs ke sath riya aur shohrat ki jagah khada ho to beshak Allah Qayamat ke din use riya aur shohrat ki jagah khada karega."
"241","Asim bin Ali ne hum se bayan kiya unhon ne kaha hum se Ibn Abi Zib ne bayan kiya Abdullah bin Saib se un ke walid se un ke dada se unhon ne kaha main ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko yani farmate hue suna Tum mein se koi apne sathi ka saman na le na khel mein aur na sanjeedagi mein pas jab tum mein se koi apne sathi ki lathi le le to use chahiye ke use us ki taraf lauta de."
"242","Muhammad bin Kaseer ne hum se bayan kiya unhon ne kaha humen Sufyan ne khabar di Amash se Abu Amr Shaibani se Hazrat Abu Masud Ansari se unhon ne farmaya Ek aadmi Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke paas aaya to us ne kaha Meri sawari thak kar baith gayi hai pas mujhe sawari ata farmaiye Aap ne farmaya Mere paas nahi lekin falan shakhs ke paas jao shayad wo tumhen sawari de de pas wo us ke paas gaya to us ne use sawari de di phir wo Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke paas aaya aur Aap ko khabar di to Aap ne farmaya Jo bhalai ki taraf rahnumai kare to us ke liye karne wale ke ajar jaisa ajar hai."
"243","Abdullah bin Abdul Wahhab ne hum se bayan kiya unhon ne kaha hum se Khalid bin Haris ne bayan kiya unhon ne kaha hum se Shubah ne bayan kiya Hisham bin Zaid se Hazrat Anas se ke ek Yahudi aurat Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke paas zeher aalud bakri lekar aayi to Aap ne us mein se khaya phir use laya gaya to kaha gaya Kya hum use qatal na kar den Aap ne farmaya Nahi unhon ne kaha Main barabar Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke halq ke kawe mein us ka asar pehchanta raha."
"244","Muhammad bin Salam ne hum se bayan kiya unhon ne kaha hum se Abu Muawiya ne bayan kiya unhon ne kaha hum se Hisham ne bayan kiya Wahb bin Kaisan se unhon ne kaha main ne Abdullah bin Zubair ko mimbar par kehte hue suna Darguzar ko pakad lo aur bhalai ka hukm do aur jahilon se munh pher lo unhon ne kaha Allah ki qasam is ka hukm nahi diya gaya magar logon ke akhlaq mein se lene ke liye aur Allah ki qasam jab tak main un ke sath rahun ga un se is ko leta rahun ga."
"245","Muhammad bin Salam ne hum se bayan kiya unhon ne kaha humen Muhammad bin Fuzail bin Ghazwan ne khabar di Laith se Taus se Hazrat Ibn Abbas se unhon ne kaha Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya Taleem do aur aasan karo aur mushkil na karo aur jab tum mein se koi ghussa ho to use chahiye ke khamosh rahe."
"246","Muhammad bin Sinan ne hum se bayan kiya unhon ne kaha hum se Falaih bin Sulaiman ne bayan kiya unhon ne kaha hum se Hilal bin Ali ne bayan kiya Ata bin Yasar se unhon ne kaha Main Abdullah bin Amr bin Aas se mila to main ne kaha Mujhe Taurat mein Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki sifat ke baare mein khabar dijiye unhon ne kaha To unhon ne farmaya Haan Allah ki qasam beshak Aap Taurat mein Quran mein jo Aap ki sifat hai us mein se baaz ke sath bayan kiye gaye hain Aye Nabi beshak Hum ne Aap ko gawah aur khushkhabri dene wala aur darane wala bana kar bheja aur ummiyon ke liye panahgah Tu Mera banda aur Mera rasool hai Main ne Tera naam Mutawakkil rakha hai na badmizaj hai aur na sakht dil aur na bazaron mein shor machane wala aur na burai ke badle burai deta hai lekin muaf karta hai aur bakhshta hai aur Allah taala use hargiz wafaat nahi dega yahan tak ke us ke zariye tedhi millat ko seedha kar de is tarah ke wo kahen Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahi aur us ke zariye andhi aankhen aur behre kaan aur ghilaf chadhe dil khol de."
"247","Abdullah bin Saleh ne hum se bayan kiya unhon ne kaha mujhe Abdul Aziz bin Abi Salama ne bayan kiya Hilal bin Abi Hilal se Ata bin Yasar se Abdullah bin Amr se unhon ne kaha Beshak ye ayat jo Quran mein hai Aye Nabi beshak Hum ne Aap ko gawah aur khushkhabri dene wala aur darane wala bana kar bheja Taurat mein bhi isi tarah hai."
"248","Ishaq bin Ala ne hum se bayan kiya unhon ne kaha hum se Amr bin Haris ne bayan kiya unhon ne kaha mujhe Abdullah bin Salim Ashari ne bayan kiya Muhammad se jo Ibn Waleed Zubaidi hain Ibn Jabir se jo Yahya bin Jabir hain Abdul Rahman bin Jubair bin Nufair se unhon ne use bayan kiya ke un ke walid ne unhen bayan kiya ke unhon ne Hazrat Muawiya ko kehte hue suna Main ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se aisi baat suni jis se Allah ne mujhe faida diya main ne Aap ko farmate hue suna ya unhon ne kaha main ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko farmate hue suna Beshak jab tum logon mein badgumani ka peecha karoge to tum unhen bigad doge pas main un mein badgumani ka peecha nahi karta ke unhen bigad dun."
"249","Muhammad bin Ubaidullah ne hum se bayan kiya unhon ne kaha hum se Hatim ne bayan kiya Muawiya bin Abi Muzarrid se un ke walid se unhon ne kaha main ne Hazrat Abu Huraira ko kehte hue suna Mere in dono kanon ne suna aur meri in dono aankhon ne dekha Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne apne dono hathon se Hasan ya Husain ki dono hatheliyon ko pakda hua tha Allah ki rehmten hon un dono par aur un ke dono qadam Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke qadmon par the aur Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam farma rahe the Upar chadh unhon ne kaha To bachcha chadha yahan tak ke us ne apne dono qadam Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke seene par rakh diye phir Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya Apna munh khol phir Aap ne use bosa diya phir farmaya Aye Allah is se mohabbat farma pas beshak main is se mohabbat karta hun."
"250","Ali ibn Abdullah ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Ismail se, Qais se, unhon ne kaha: main ne Jarir ko kehte hue suna: jab se main Islam laya hun Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne mujhe kabhi nahi dekha magar mere chehre ki taraf muskuraye, aur Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: is darwaze se Yemen walon me se behtareen logon me se ek mard dakhil hoga, us ke chehre par farishte ka masha hai, pas Jarir dakhil hue."
"251","Ahmad ibn Isa ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah ibn Wahb ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr ibn al-Harith ne hamen khabar di ke Abu al-Nadr ne un se bayan kiya, Sulaiman ibn Yasar se, Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki zauja Aisha se, unhon ne farmaya: main ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko hargiz hanste hue nahi dekha yahan tak ke main un ke halaq ke kauwe dekh lun, balke woh sirf muskurate the sallallahu alaihi wasallam, unhon ne kaha: aur jab woh badal ya hawa dekhte to un ke chehre me pehchana jata, to unhon ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool, log jab badal dekhte hain to khush hote hain is ummid par ke us me barish hogi, aur main aap ko dekhti hun ke jab aap use dekhte hain to aap ke chehre me nagawari pehchani jati hai, to unhon ne farmaya: Ae Aisha, mujhe kya itmenan hai ke us me azab na ho, ek qaum ko hawa se azab diya gaya, aur ek qaum ne azab ko aate dekha to unhon ne kaha: ye badal hum par barish barsane wala hai."
"252","Sulaiman ibn Dawud Abu al-Rabi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ismail ibn Zakariya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Raja ne hum se bayan kiya, Burd se, Makhul se, Wathila ibn al-Asqa se, Hazrat Abu Huraira se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: hansi kam karo, pas beshak zyada hansi dil ko murda kar deti hai."
"253","Muhammad ibn Bashshar ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Bakr al-Hanafi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdul Hamid ibn Jafar ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibrahim ibn Abdullah se, Hazrat Abu Huraira se, Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se, unhon ne farmaya: zyada hansi na hansa karo, pas beshak zyada hansi dil ko murda kar deti hai."
"254","Musa ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Rabi ibn Muslim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad ibn Ziyad ne hum se bayan kiya, Hazrat Abu Huraira se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam apne sahaba ke ek giroh ki taraf nikle jo hans rahe the aur baaten kar rahe the, to unhon ne farmaya: qasam us zat ki jis ke hath me meri jaan hai, agar tum jante jo main janta hun to tum thoda hanste aur bahut rote, phir woh wapas tashreef le gaye aur qaum ko rula diya, aur Allah Azza wa Jall ne un ki taraf wahi bheji: Ae Muhammad, tum mere bandon ko kyun na ummid karte ho, to Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam wapas tashreef laye to farmaya: khushkhabri pao aur durust raho aur darmiyani raah ikhtiyar karo."
"255","Bishr ibn Muhammad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah ne hamen khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Usama ibn Zaid ne hamen khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Musa ibn Muslim maula bint Qariz ne mujhe khabar di, Hazrat Abu Huraira se ke woh kabhi Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se riwayat bayan karte to kehte: mujh se palkon ke ghane lambe balon wale, pehluon ke safed wale ne bayan kiya, jab woh mutawajjih hote to mukammal taur par mutawajjih hote, aur jab peeth pherte to mukammal taur par peeth pherte, kisi aankh ne un jaisa nahi dekha aur na kabhi dekhegi."
